    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds like a solid start. i'm just trying to figure out if i should prioritize certain variables. when i look at the raw data trends for these high-theft areas, there's a pretty clear overlap with areas that have seen a major increase in minority populations over the last decade. do you think it's safer to treat ethnic composition as a primary predictor in the model, or would that be seen as too much of a stretch for an actuarial report?",
